{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261119%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳案　前夫、家翁及大伯否認謀殺罪｜續審<br/>► 1000　33庭　暫委法官王詩麗<br/>以$1,000行賄物業代理助瞞違約撻訂　城大副教授杜渡罪成囚4個半月｜提訊<br/>► 1000　28庭　上訴庭法官高浩文<br/>物業涉僭建遭發清拆令　胡漢清求「解釘」遭拒續提覆核｜宣布判決</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1030　25庭　暫委法官鄧少雄<br/>興達大廈大維修圍標案｜續審<br/>► 1015　26庭　法官嚴舜儀<br/>浸大學生會銀行賬戶失款案兩前成員與另一男子被控串謀欺詐等｜提訊<br/>涉騙「百分百擔保」600萬元貸款中科監察主席潘焯鴻與妻子被控5罪｜提訊</p>\n<p>🔸觀塘法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官李志豪<br/>涉鄭植之中學小賣部偷12.5萬元　職員被控盜竊｜答辯</p>\n<p>🔸屯門法院<br/>► 0939　7庭　裁判官覃有方<br/>元朗水蕉新村套丁案　官終止聆訊｜聆訊<br/>► 0930　6庭　暫委裁判官李栩政<br/>六旬漢涉用鐮刀襲狗｜裁決</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:08:57.021185+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":483,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T12:59:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T16:17:39.045880+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T13:02:12.295540+00:00","content_hash":"412c82c07f89997d552fab80cf85bc1d0b1fdaec8deff0322d659167015b1c95","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}